# UI components

Full spec: `DESIGN.md` + `docs/design/FOUNDATIONS.md` + `docs/design/COMPONENT_STANDARDS.md`.

## Tailwind tokens (summary)

- Surfaces: `bg-surface`, `bg-surface-hover`, `bg-surface-container`, `border-border`
- Text: `text-foreground`, `text-foreground-secondary`, `text-muted`, `text-accent`
- Chinese text: `hanzi-display`, `hanzi-lg` utility classes
- Accent (primary action): `bg-accent`, `text-accent`, `border-accent`, `hover:bg-accent-hover`
- Semantic: `text-success`, `text-warning`, `text-error`
- Spacing: use scale only — `p-4`, `gap-6`, `space-y-8` (see FOUNDATIONS.md)
- Radius: `rounded-control`, `rounded-card`, `rounded-pill`
- Z-index: `z-sticky`, `z-dropdown`, `z-overlay`, `z-dialog`, `z-toast`

## Components (`src/components/ui/`)

Use before creating new primitives: `Button`, `Input`, `Card`, `Dialog`, `Sheet`, `Toast`, `EmptyState`, `ErrorState`, `Badge`, `FormField`, `Tabs`, `Skeleton`, `Spinner`.

Showcase: `/dev/ui`

## Patterns

- Functional components; extract hooks for reusable client logic
- Vietnamese UI copy for user-facing strings
- Use `cn()` from `@/lib/cn` for conditional classes
- App Router: `'use client'` only when needed

## Do not

- Use `text-muted-foreground` (use `text-muted`)
- Use `hanzi-xl` (use `hanzi-lg` or `hanzi-display`)
- Add inline styles when Tailwind utilities exist
- Use `btn-primary` / `card-paper` in new code — use `Button` / `Card` components
